Latent Trace uses Alembic for PostgreSQL/PostGIS schema changes.

From an authorized checkout, install the locked development dependencies,
export DATABASE_URL for the intended local database, and run:

    uv run --extra dev alembic upgrade head

Start from an empty database with the baseline, then apply every later revision.
Do not edit an already-deployed migration to change behavior; add a revision.
Review data migrations against a private backup and test upgrades before deploy.
Production targets and destructive downgrades require an explicit recovery plan.

See docs/development.md and docs/deploy/runbook.md.
